# Contract: VLA System Interfaces

## Overview
This document defines the interfaces and data schemas that will be referenced in the VLA Integration Module documentation.

## Speech Recognition Interface

### Voice Command Schema
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "audio_input": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Raw audio data or file reference"
    },
    "transcript": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Text transcription of the audio"
    },
    "confidence": {
      "type": "number",
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 1,
      "description": "Confidence score of the transcription"
    },
    "timestamp": {
      "type": "string",
      "format": "date-time",
      "description": "When the command was received"
    }
  },
  "required": ["audio_input", "transcript"]
}
```

## LLM Processing Interface

### Natural Language Command Schema
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "input_text": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Natural language command from user"
    },
    "intent": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Detected intent from the command"
    },
    "entities": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Type of entity (object, location, action, etc.)"
          },
          "value": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Value of the entity"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "action_sequence": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Type of action to perform"
          },
          "parameters": {
            "type": "object",
            "description": "Parameters for the action"
          },
          "priority": {
            "type": "integer",
            "description": "Priority level of the action"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "required": ["input_text", "action_sequence"]
}
```

## ROS 2 Action Interface

### Robot Action Schema
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "action_name": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Name of the ROS 2 action to execute"
    },
    "parameters": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Parameters for the action"
    },
    "execution_context": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "robot_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Identifier of the target robot"
        },
        "environment_context": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Environmental information for action execution"
        }
      }
    },
    "status": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["pending", "executing", "completed", "failed", "cancelled"],
      "description": "Current status of the action"
    }
  },
  "required": ["action_name", "parameters"]
}
```

## Vision Processing Interface

### Perception Data Schema
```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "sensor_data": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "image": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Image data from vision sensors"
        },
        "depth": {
          "type": "object",
          "description": "Depth information if available"
        }
      }
    },
    "detected_objects": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "object_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Type of detected object"
          },
          "position": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "x": {"type": "number"},
              "y": {"type": "number"},
              "z": {"type": "number"}
            }
          },
          "confidence": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 1
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```